+|---|---|---|
+| `Module`, `FuncDef`, `Params("l","t")` | SY1, SY3, SY4, SY5 | R1; every `krun` log |
+| statement sequence and `.Stmts` | SY2 | R2-R3; empty and nonempty cases |
